# ── Public website environment ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Copy to `.env.production` (committed) or `.env.production.local` (git-ignored)
# and fill in before running `npm run build`. All values are baked into the
# static bundle at build time, so rebuild after changing them.

# Base URL the site uses for every /api/... request.
#
#   Leave EMPTY (or omit) when the site is served from the SAME origin as the
#   API — relative paths just work. This is the default and covers local dev
#   (the package.json "proxy" handles it).
#
#   Set to the API's absolute base URL for a CROSS-ORIGIN deploy, e.g. the site
#   on the root domain and the API/admin server on a subdomain:
# REACT_APP_API_URL=https://admin.sandhyagrand.in
